{"id":"a48deec92f1ddb01","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set.md","title":"Oracle Recursively Enumerable Set","display":"df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set — Oracle Recursively Enumerable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set","aliases":["68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set"],"display":"df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set — Oracle Recursively Enumerable Set","depends_on":["[[68-df-oracle-computation]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§12 pp.39-43; §13 p.48; §14 p.49 / PDF 48-52,57-58","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"not-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set — Oracle Recursively Enumerable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"124259d2584af1b6\" href=\"?note=124259d2584af1b6\" title=\"68-df-oracle-computation\">68-df-oracle-computation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§12 pp.39-43; §13 p.48; §14 p.49 / PDF 48-52,57-58"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^A\">\\(\\varphi_e^A\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"124259d2584af1b6\" href=\"?note=124259d2584af1b6\" title=\"68-df-oracle-computation\">68-df-oracle-computation</a> 定义的 oracle 偏函数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e^A\">\\(W_e^A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}^A\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}^A\\)</span> 为以下引入的对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W_e^A:=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e^A),\\qquad\\mathrm{RE}^A:=\\{W_e^A:e\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W_e^A:=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e^A),\\qquad\\mathrm{RE}^A:=\\{W_e^A:e\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §14 的定义按 §12 及 p.48 的相对化约定扩展到单个集合 oracle。这里只给相对 RE 的定义，不暗中把相对 RE 等同相对可判定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"124259d2584af1b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"124259d2584af1b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$e\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\varphi_e^A$ 是 [[68-df-oracle-computation]] 定义的 oracle 偏函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e^A","display":false},{"tex":"W_e^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}^A","display":false},{"tex":"W_e^A:=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e^A),\\qquad\\mathrm{RE}^A:=\\{W_e^A:e\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1100,"backlinks":[{"id":"87e145f3544aae62","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\le_T,<_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-reducibility]]，$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-equivalence]]；跳跃见 [[68-df-turing-jump]]；$\\mathrm{RE}^A$ 见 [[68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set]]；$K$ 见 [[68-df-halting-set]]。"},{"id":"3a9f1c3bbe45ef77","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-105","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set|df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set — Oracle Recursively Enumerable Set]]"}],"outgoing":["124259d2584af1b6"]}